      "title": "Tamil Nadu among pronounced drought hotspots as South Peninsular India sees strongest drought trend: study",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/tamil-nadu-among-pronounced-drought-hotspots-as-south-peninsular-india-sees-strongest-drought-trend-study/article71512533.ece",
      "description": "While less than 10% of the region was affected by drought in much of the period before the 1990s, several years after 2000 saw more than 40% of the region under drought conditions",
